Package: lighttpd
Version: 1.4.76-r3
Description: Lightweight high-performance web server
 Lightweight high-performance web server is designed and optimized for
 high performance environments. With a small memory footprint compared to
 other web-servers, effective management of the cpu-load, and advanced
 feature set (FastCGI, SCGI, Auth, Output-Compression, URL-Rewriting and
 many more)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: BSD-3-Clause
Architecture: armv7vet2hf-neon
OE: lighttpd
Homepage: http://www.lighttpd.net/
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libcrypto3 (>= 3.0.10), libpcre2 (>= 10.34), lighttpd-module-auth, lighttpd-module-authn-file, lighttpd-module-cgi, lighttpd-module-dirlisting, lighttpd-module-openssl, lighttpd-module-webdav
Recommends: lighttpd-module-accesslog
Source: lighttpd_1.4.76.bb
